{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"0d3187ce707785640a648d57fa80f702093c1ec6415e397c471e1b3d7a5b10e9"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:e58386e960e461afe69c78353dec589f53c9c2288d25a68412d5472cc5a1b350","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"A major athletic brand that fits his active lifestyle","evidence":"[D3:15 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: Thanks! The Nike and Gatorade deals have me stoked! I've always liked Under Armour, working with them would be really cool.\n[D25:2 | 10:04 am on 19 December, 2023] John: Yo Tim! Great to hear from you. Things have been wild! Last week I got this amazing deal with a renowned outdoor gear company. So pumped!","itemId":"urn:uuid:db309e8f-86ee-52bc-9c9a-c1956cf706a3","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:e2b7f69041d8045f56fae5fb2a58c8c43501b41eb7be8162d3856d12c64129cc","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which outdoor gear company likely signed up John for an endorsement deal?","referenceAnswer":"Under Armour","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"e2b7f69041d8045f56fae5fb2a58c8c43501b41eb7be8162d3856d12c64129cc"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}